This package contains TypeScript code translated from splitmix64.c by
Sebastiano Vigna, available at https://github.com/jj1bdx/xorshiftplus-c
and on Vigna's PRNG page at https://prng.di.unimi.it/. The upstream is
dedicated to the public domain (CC0).

  Written in 2015 by Sebastiano Vigna (vigna@acm.org)

Algorithm: SplitMix64 — Stafford's variant of Vigna's splittable RNG,
same as Java 8's SplittableRandom.
